    <briefdescription>
<para>Streaming consumer that builds a <computeroutput><ref refid="_basic_poly_list_8hpp_a24fbc5f5eec7472cd3ee08f9f323741e_1a24fbc5f5eec7472cd3ee08f9f323741e" kindref="member">BasicPolyList</ref></computeroutput> from per-term callbacks, matching the mathicgb / mgb stream interface. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Receives <computeroutput><ref refid="class_basic_poly_list_stream_collector_ad431a81a8076f2945b148b132531ba1a_1ad431a81a8076f2945b148b132531ba1a" kindref="member">appendPolynomialBegin</ref> / <ref refid="class_basic_poly_list_stream_collector_aeb0983b25516b4dcc149a29202b7984a_1aeb0983b25516b4dcc149a29202b7984a" kindref="member">appendTermBegin</ref> / <ref refid="class_basic_poly_list_stream_collector_a73b8c5248c74aacc6a35a2c4c39c14ad_1a73b8c5248c74aacc6a35a2c4c39c14ad" kindref="member">appendExponent</ref> / <ref refid="class_basic_poly_list_stream_collector_a175fc67386541e3d75deda1ae56000e9_1a175fc67386541e3d75deda1ae56000e9" kindref="member">appendTermDone</ref> / <ref refid="class_basic_poly_list_stream_collector_a6b0ff259b7c3d891af9693c172d76d90_1a6b0ff259b7c3d891af9693c172d76d90" kindref="member">appendPolynomialDone</ref></computeroutput> calls from a polynomial producer (typically the mathicgb stream parser) and assembles the result into <computeroutput><ref refid="class_basic_poly_list_stream_collector_a15b6d66a77bd2622331b46b7ea2863b3_1a15b6d66a77bd2622331b46b7ea2863b3" kindref="member">mValue</ref></computeroutput>. Stores the declared modulus, variable count, and component count so the caller can ask the collector to echo them back even though the <computeroutput><ref refid="class_basic_poly" kindref="compound">BasicPoly</ref></computeroutput> representation itself does not use them. Used for portable polynomial I/O outside the typed <computeroutput><ref refid="class_ring" kindref="compound">Ring</ref></computeroutput> machinery. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
